    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Cute Star Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the universe in the 8-bit adventure of <i>Cute Star Heroes</i>! This is a charming retro platformer with vibrant characters, rich levels, and the spirit of classic games. Travel across eight unique worlds to stop Lord Hades and restore balance to the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of two heroes: <strong>Pami</strong> \u2014 a brave rabbit charging into danger, or <strong>Lumi</strong> \u2014 a lively cat with a bright personality. Jump, fight, solve puzzles, and overcome surprising challenges \u2014 from lava flows to high-speed sky rides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Classic 8-bit style platformer \u2014 inspired by the golden age of the NES.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30 Two playable characters \u2014 choose between Pami and Lumi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d 8 unique worlds \u2014 jungles, underwater ruins, volcanoes, and sky-surfing levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Varied gameplay \u2014 platforming, shoot-'em-up, runner sections, and boss battles in every world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Local co-op \u2014 play solo or together on one device, just like in childhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Original chiptune soundtrack \u2014 created in authentic NES style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Full controller support \u2014 including DualShock and popular gamepads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 Available in 7 languages, including Russian, English, German, and Spanish.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Cute Star Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the universe in the 8-bit adventure of <i>Cute Star Heroes</i>! This is a charming retro platformer with vibrant characters, rich levels, and the spirit of classic games. Travel across eight unique worlds to stop Lord Hades and restore balance to the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of two heroes: <strong>Pami</strong> \u2014 a brave rabbit charging into danger, or <strong>Lumi</strong> \u2014 a lively cat with a bright personality. Jump, fight, solve puzzles, and overcome surprising challenges \u2014 from lava flows to high-speed sky rides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Classic 8-bit style platformer \u2014 inspired by the golden age of the NES.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc30 Two playable characters \u2014 choose between Pami and Lumi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d 8 unique worlds \u2014 jungles, underwater ruins, volcanoes, and sky-surfing levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Varied gameplay \u2014 platforming, shoot-'em-up, runner sections, and boss battles in every world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Local co-op \u2014 play solo or together on one device, just like in childhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Original chiptune soundtrack \u2014 created in authentic NES style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Full controller support \u2014 including DualShock and popular gamepads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 Available in 7 languages, including Russian, English, German, and Spanish.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "When ancient evil returns in the form of Lord Hades, the fate of the galaxy rests in the paws of two unlikely heroes. Defend the universe, overcome challenges, and become true Star Heroes! Cute Star Heroes is a cute but challenging game that brings back the magic of retro classics.",
